OL,3,GNEWSAMobile tattoo and piercing
OL,4,Abusinesses banned
OL,5,
OL,6,FMobile tattoo and piercing businesses
OL,7,Fwill not be allowed to operate under a
OL,8,Fnew council policy.
OL,10,FThe policy was agreed by North Devon
OL,11,FCouncil after inquiries were received
OL,12,Ffrom businesses who wanted to provide
OL,13,Ftattooing, cosmetic piercing and other
OL,14,Fskin treatments from mobile units.
OL,16,FBusinesses offering these services have
OL,17,Fbeen told they will can only operate
OL,18,Ffrom fixed premises which can be
OL,19,Finspected and registered.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
